  ## Projected recursive commit authority for propagated Same branches. The
  ## child indices remain existential and independent of the selected child;
  ## the intact aligned carrier retains that right-hand authority separately.
  ## Later Empty-returning consumers may align the two, but this constructor
  ## never uses erased equality to manufacture a shared runtime package.
