  ## Root-relative destination exhaustion is the third terminal local-failure
  ## leaf. This boundary deliberately requires the selected path to begin at
  ## the same active commit candidate. The outer escaped-prefix dispatcher must
  ## establish that cursor alignment before calling it; comparing origins one
  ## transition too early is ill-typed and causes pathological normalization.
